    "scrapling_abstract": "A series of \nlandslides\n occurred in Punjirimattom, \nMundakkai\n, \nChooralmala\n, and \nVellarimala\n villages in \nMeppadi\n panchayat, \nVythiri\n taluk\n[\n5\n]\n in \nWayanad district\n, \nKerala\n, India in the early hours of 30 July 2024. The landslides were caused by heavy rains that caused hillsides to collapse onto the areas below. The disaster was one of the deadliest in Kerala's history, with reports of 420 fatalities,\n[\n6\n]\n[\n7\n]\n 397 injuries,\n[\n8\n]\n and 118 people missing.\n[\n7\n]\n[\n8\n]\nDeforestation\n, seismic sensitivity, poor building construction, and \nglobal warming\n have been identified as possible causes for the landslides and fatalities.",
